{"about_the_game":"Mighty Knight Legacy is a 2D action RPG which lets you play solo with AI or together with your friends/families. Unlock different heroes as you progress, have access to various upgrades, and dive into new challenges. Build your team and march ahead for mighty battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play Your Way \u2013 Team up with friends, family, or let smart bots join your side.<br></li><li>Unlock Legendary Heroes \u2013 Discover and recruit new warriors.<br></li><li>Upgrade &amp; Dominate \u2013 Power up your squad with upgrades.<br></li><li>Face Fresh Challenges \u2013 New enemies, new levels, new challenges.<br></li><li>Nerve Wrecking Bosses - Plenty of minibosses and bosses with different characteristics to fight. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/9cd4f67a9aa61dd4bb06d97799b5874c.avif?t=1758617057\" width=780 height=136 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/effb2eb3c7b61a09064f6e206be09af8.poster.avif?t=1758617057\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/effb2eb3c7b61a09064f6e206be09af8.webm?t=1758617057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/effb2eb3c7b61a09064f6e206be09af8.mp4?t=1758617057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every hero wields different weapons and possess their own unique abilities. Learn as you go, practice makes perfect! Utilize their abilities at the right time and step closer towards victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/65b199e5b2f573eee741c2d969dbb6c3.avif?t=1758617057\" width=780 height=152 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/7ba35093184a9e48363d0ab152262eaf.poster.avif?t=1758617057\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/7ba35093184a9e48363d0ab152262eaf.webm?t=1758617057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/7ba35093184a9e48363d0ab152262eaf.mp4?t=1758617057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Bunch of wicked creatures to defeat, from skeleton warriors to hard-rock golems and dragons. Beware of different kinds of threats they may bring upon you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/9ad95474bb96e2ddf24dfbdee584e303.avif?t=1758617057\" width=780 height=148 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/3a4b720ff6e803e92ee68dc4697f08ea.poster.avif?t=1758617057\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/3a4b720ff6e803e92ee68dc4697f08ea.webm?t=1758617057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676990/extras/3a4b720ff6e803e92ee68dc4697f08ea.mp4?t=1758617057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in epic battle against these nerve-wrecking bosses. Do not let your guard down cause they are ready to stop you from reaching the demon's lair! Give it your all and vanquish them!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676990?t=1758617057","ba